                        "form": "ана́томах"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "cc127e80-6c1d-335f-96ce-19e597299493",
                        "entry_id": "71adc4e4-9ba6-32a6-88fb-737ef7ceb967",
                        "glosses": [
                            "учёный, занимающийся анатомией, или вообще человек, изучающий строение живых организмов"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "26c1df67-3cf8-49c6-ae89-ff9a9b38f2fd",
                                "sense_id": "cc127e80-6c1d-335f-96ce-19e597299493",
                                "text": "Не только учёный анатом, проводящий всю жизнь в работе над трупами в интересах науки, но даже огрубелый палач не сохраняет полного равнодушия при виде трупа, положенного во гробе и обставленного всем, чем крепка христианская могила."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "56b8897a-d7f6-4272-aded-6ca88f4bfc44",
                        "source_entry_id": "71adc4e4-9ba6-32a6-88fb-737ef7ceb967",
                        "source_sense_id": "cc127e80-6c1d-335f-96ce-19e597299493",
                        "target_lang_word": "anatomist",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "anatomist",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c2f58d9c-a2f9-3c28-a0b5-ebcffeb0a8d6",
                                        "entry_id": "5077b020-c864-324b-aa02-4179954042c7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who studies, teaches, writes on, or does research on anatomy and anatomical structures."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "68b991f6-2b20-4964-b85a-a762db97dec2",
                                                "sense_id": "c2f58d9c-a2f9-3c28-a0b5-ebcffeb0a8d6",
                                                "text": "But we can no longer regard the mere fact of these diffuse condensations of the lung becoming yellow and caseous as an evidence of their tuberculous nature, especially since the pathological anatomists, and among them Virchow, have shown that formations of the most different kind, having not the slightest connection with tubercule— as, for example, old cancerous masses, lymphatic glands swollen by a hyperplasia of cells, hæmorrhagical infarctions, abscesses, &c.— undergo exactly the same caseous transformation."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5bc809de-c4b5-4d96-b9b6-b8bbed199a5c",
                                                "sense_id": "c2f58d9c-a2f9-3c28-a0b5-ebcffeb0a8d6",
                                                "text": "A plant anatomist receiving such samples can remove pickled wood and bark for anatomical study, then dry the remaining portions for inclusion in a xylarium."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2fedf1d4-714f-4528-8df6-8e09338ccb8d",
                                                "sense_id": "c2f58d9c-a2f9-3c28-a0b5-ebcffeb0a8d6",
                                                "text": "Gall's science of “bump reading” would ultimately be abandoned as much for its fixation on social categories as for an inability within the scientific community to replicate its findings. These scientific failings would be exposed by anatomists like Paul Broca (1861) and Carl Wernicke (1874) who pioneered the alternative neuroscientific method of lesion–symptom mapping."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "181e8475-1059-490f-ac57-7543b2542a19",
                        "source_entry_id": "71adc4e4-9ba6-32a6-88fb-737ef7ceb967",
                        "source_sense_id": "cc127e80-6c1d-335f-96ce-19e597299493",
                        "target_lang_word": "Anatom",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Anatom",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "651ca27b-510a-3d79-9cbe-7f78676af2c9",
                                        "entry_id": "ca28e102-ef9b-3e12-9a8e-be6e46b4f0c1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Wissenschaftler aus dem Gebiet der Anatomie"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e132bbcd-b7c4-426c-bae9-eb3b5e400c5c",
                                                "sense_id": "651ca27b-510a-3d79-9cbe-7f78676af2c9",
                                                "text": "„So vehement war dieses Wachstum, daß einige ältere Anatomen es mit dem eines Tumors verglichen haben.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "900368a9-70bd-4f93-94dc-97db5db4d14a",
                                                "sense_id": "651ca27b-510a-3d79-9cbe-7f78676af2c9",
                                                "text": "„Die beiden Anatomen taten so, als setzten sie ihre Untersuchungen fort.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2dca3184-2747-4336-b9d2-f1dce535b18c",
                        "source_entry_id": "71adc4e4-9ba6-32a6-88fb-737ef7ceb967",
                        "source_sense_id": "cc127e80-6c1d-335f-96ce-19e597299493",
                        "target_lang_word": "Anatomin",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Anatomin",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d4a4c61c-d722-3c03-bab0-cf4331ec2308",
                                        "entry_id": "b65111bd-186c-3352-821d-828fecc0aec1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Wissenschaftlerin auf dem Gebiet der Anatomie"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "37d147ab-b600-45fb-8d68-e046a58eb55c",
                                                "sense_id": "d4a4c61c-d722-3c03-bab0-cf4331ec2308",
                                                "text": "„Dr. Adele Hartmann ist in München – in der vorkommunistischen Zeit – als Anatomin zu den Vorlesungen zugelassen worden!“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3e44effb-e207-48df-bbc6-802d403d5d88",
                        "source_entry_id": "71adc4e4-9ba6-32a6-88fb-737ef7ceb967",
                        "source_sense_id": "cc127e80-6c1d-335f-96ce-19e597299493",
                        "target_lang_word": "anatomist",
                        "target_lang_code": "tr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "anatomist",
                                "target_lang_code": "tr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2f4b53a4-180b-3b96-978e-27420c5cf3d1",
                                        "entry_id": "06d47084-65ed-3a14-be8b-b90ae49caaa4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "tıp alanında, pratik uygulamaları geliştiren, hayvan ve insanın diğer gövdebilim özelliklerini yapı ve biçim bakımından bilimsel olarak araştıran kişi"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "meslekler"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "bb496cca-6d37-48a7-8222-fcef008be960",
                        "source_entry_id": "71adc4e4-9ba6-32a6-88fb-737ef7ceb967",
                        "source_sense_id": "cc127e80-6c1d-335f-96ce-19e597299493",
                        "target_lang_word": "anatomiste",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "anatomiste",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "26075de2-da96-3e60-817f-4eeab61882c4",
                                        "entry_id": "e6769474-d515-33ac-8909-3fca23cfe732",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Celui, celle qui est versé dans l’anatomie."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "555abd21-93ed-4c45-b6ef-53351d5af198",
                                                "sense_id": "26075de2-da96-3e60-817f-4eeab61882c4",
                                                "text": "On doit, sans perdre un instant, extirper la tumeur : opération qui exige la main d’un anatomiste, et qui n’est pas sans danger pour celui qui la pratique, l’inoculation de l’ichor gangreneux pouvant causer la mort."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f837ac78-0b47-4710-a8cd-8be38eadd125",
                                                "sense_id": "26075de2-da96-3e60-817f-4eeab61882c4",
                                                "text": "Mais la face interne de l'épiderme, considéré dans ces parties, n'appelle pas moins, quoique sous un autre rapport, l'attention de l’anatomiste."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2b6bf659-c2d8-41fc-85a8-2afe0a2d804f",
                                                "sense_id": "26075de2-da96-3e60-817f-4eeab61882c4",
                                                "text": "Et sa passion de la vie, son admiration des forces de la vie suffisaient à le jeter dans une perpétuelle joie, d’où semblait couler naturellement son amour des autres, un attendrissement fraternel, une sympathie, qu’on sentait sous sa rudesse d’anatomiste et sous l’impersonnalité affectée de ses études."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2e2d8c81-40df-4ef2-ab5f-cf68521d00c7",
                                                "sense_id": "26075de2-da96-3e60-817f-4eeab61882c4",
                                                "text": "L’anatomiste est habile à sectionner."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "852e450e-0701-30b9-8e27-d575a8cde3c9",
                                        "entry_id": "e6769474-d515-33ac-8909-3fca23cfe732",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Celui qui connait bien un sujet d'étude."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "79d9585a-ade3-41b3-a954-dca5e5945a94",
                                                "sense_id": "852e450e-0701-30b9-8e27-d575a8cde3c9",
                                                "text": "Ce romancier est un savant anatomiste du cœur humain."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
